      "content": "hey, i had a weird moment earlier. i stood up from the couch and just suddenly felt super lightheaded and everything went black for a few seconds. i didn't fall but it was scary. i think i might just be dehydrated or something since it's been hot lately. should i just drink some water and keep an eye on it or is that something i need to worry about?",
